---
import BaseHead from '../../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import InternationalLessonChrome from '../../../components/InternationalLessonChrome.astro';
import InternationalLessonChrome from '../../../components/InternationalLessonChrome.astro';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/')?import.meta.env.BASE_URL:import.meta.env.BASE_URL+'/';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><BaseHead title="From Gesture to Value · HARUM NOIR" description="A visual drawing lesson in gesture, silhouette, light and shadow masses, and selective synthesis in charcoal." alternates={[{hreflang:"pt-BR",href:base+"colecoes/estudo-tonal/"},{hreflang:"en",href:base+"en/collections/tonal-study/"},{hreflang:"es",href:base+"es/colecciones/estudio-tonal/"}]}/></head><body><InternationalLessonChrome lang="en" ptHref={base+'colecoes/estudo-tonal/'} enHref={base+'en/collections/tonal-study/'} esHref={base+'es/colecciones/estudio-tonal/'}><main class="lesson"><header class="lesson-head"><a class="back" href={base+'en/collections/'}>← All collections</a><div class="eyebrow">COLLECTION 02 · FORM AND LIGHT</div><h1>From gesture to value.</h1><p class="intro">Draw the same pear in four decisions. Each stage solves one visual problem; stop when the form reads clearly.</p></header><figure class="study"><img src={base+'noir/visual-atlas/estudo-tonal-pera.webp'} alt="Four charcoal studies of the same pear and cloth: gesture, silhouette, light and shadow masses, and a resolved drawing." width="720" height="480" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>Original teaching plate created with AI assistance; a process demonstration, not a historical artwork.</figcaption></figure><section class="steps" aria-labelledby="steps-title"><div class="eyebrow">PRACTICE · 12 MINUTES</div><h2 id="steps-title">Four decisions on paper.</h2><ol><li><strong>Gesture · 2 min</strong><span>Mark the axis, tilt and overall width with light lines.</span></li><li><strong>Silhouette · 3 min</strong><span>Find the pear's contour and the cloth's largest fold. Compare proportions.</span></li><li><strong>Value · 4 min</strong><span>Separate light, halftone and shadow into broad masses; keep paper light.</span></li><li><strong>Synthesis · 3 min</strong><span>Choose a few edges to strengthen. Soften what does not clarify the form.</span></li></ol></section><aside class="question"><div class="eyebrow">ATELIER QUESTION</div><p>Which edge explains the volume best: the darkest, the sharpest, or the one that disappears?</p><span>Make a short second study and keep one decision that feels like your own.</span></aside><nav class="lesson-nav" aria-label="Lesson navigation"><a href={base+'en/collections/'}>← All collections</a><a href={base+'en/drawing/'}>Back to drawing →</a></nav></main></InternationalLessonChrome></body></html>
<style>
.lesson{max-width:1040px;margin:auto;padding:clamp(24px,5vw,64px) clamp(18px,5vw,64px) 80px;color:var(--paper)}.lesson-head{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 32px}.back{display:inline-block;color:var(--paper-2);font-size:.78rem;margin-bottom:32px}.lesson-head h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:14px 0}.intro{max-width:56ch;color:var(--paper-2);font-size:1.04rem;line-height:1.7}.study{margin:0 auto 48px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#111}.study img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.study figcaption{padding:10px 14px;color:var(--paper-2);font-size:.72rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.steps{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto}.steps h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,3rem);margin:12px 0 22px}.steps ol{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.steps li{display:grid;gap:8px;padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#111;border-radius:10px}.steps li strong{color:var(--gold)}.steps li span,.question span{color:var(--paper-2);font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6}.question{max-width:760px;margin:36px auto;padding:22px;border-left:3px solid var(--gold);background:#151515}.question p{font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.45;margin:10px 0}.lesson-nav{max-width:760px;margin:36px auto 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}.lesson-nav a{color:var(--gold)}@media(max-width:580px){.steps ol{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lesson-head{margin-bottom:24px}.back{margin-bottom:24px}.lesson-nav{flex-direction:column}}
</style>